<h1>AutoPlaneExtract</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p class="description"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> F<span lang="EN-GB">its and creates datum planes to the visible mesh selections</span>.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Parameters</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span style="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold;"><i><b>RMS</b></i></span>  <span lang="EN-GB">RMS threshold when fitting planes</span>.</p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>UI Commands</b></span>:</p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><i style="font-style:italic;">Datuming &gt; Auto Extract &gt; Plane</i> from the main menu. <b>Ctrl + Alt + 3</b> shortcut.</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">Example:</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">AutoPlaneExtract( RMS=0.10000 )</p>
<p class="ExampleCode">&#160;</p>

